#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    click: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    add_cart: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    purchase: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    favorite: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    share: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights[type] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用户兴趣的时间衰减是画像建模的关键设计。用户的兴趣会随时间变化，最近的行为更能反映当前偏好。指数衰减是最常用的方法：历史交互的权重按时间距离指数递减。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>衰减策略</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指数衰减</td>\n<td>w(t) = e^(-λΔt)</td>\n<td>近期行为权重高</td>\n<td>兴趣变化快（短视频）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性衰减</td>\n<td>w(t) = max(0, 1 - αΔt)</td>\n<td>平滑递减</td>\n<td>兴趣变化平缓（电商）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯衰减</td>\n<td>w(t) = w_period</td>\n<td>按时间段分权重</td>\n<td>周期性兴趣（节日消费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不衰减</td>\n<td>w(t) = 1</td>\n<td>历史等权</td>\n<td>长期稳定偏好（图书）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实时画像的构建对推荐系统的时效性至关重要。用户在当前 Session 中的行为（浏览了哪些商品、搜索了什么关键词）是预测即时兴趣的最强信号。工业系统通常使用 Flink 或 Kafka Streams 等流处理框架实时聚合用户行为，在毫秒级别更新用户的实时特征。实时特征与离线画像特征的融合方式通常采用 Concat 或 Attention 机制，让模型自动学习两类特征的权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物品表示学习\">物品表示学习</h2><p>物品表示学习将物品的多维特征编码为稠密向量，使得语义相似的物品在向量空间中距离更近。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ItemFeatures {&#10;  itemId: string;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  category: string[];&#10;  tags: string[];&#10;  price: number;&#10;  imageUrl: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  statistics: ItemStatistics;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ItemStatistics {&#10;  impressionCount: number;&#10;  clickCount: number;&#10;  purchaseCount: number;&#10;  avgRating: number;&#10;  reviewCount: number;&#10;  ctr: number;&#10;  cvr: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ItemEmbedding {&#10;  itemId: string;&#10;  idEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;  contentEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;  cfEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;  fusedEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function fuseItemEmbeddings(&#10;  idEmb: Float32Array,&#10;  contentEmb: Float32Array,&#10;  cfEmb: Float32Array,&#10;  weights: [number, number, number],&#10;): Float32Array {&#10;  const dim = idEmb.length;&#10;  const fused = new Float32Array(dim);&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; dim; i++) {&#10;    fused[i] = weights[0] * idEmb[i] + weights[1] * contentEmb[i] + weights[2] * cfEmb[i];&#10;  }&#10;  return l2Normalize(fused);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function item2vecTraining(sessions: string[][], embeddingDim: number, windowSize: number): Map&lt;string, Float32Array&gt; {&#10;  const embeddings = new Map&lt;string, Float32Array&gt;();&#10;  for (const session of sessions) {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; session.length; i++) {&#10;      const center = session[i];&#10;      const start = Math.max(0, i - windowSize);&#10;      const end = Math.min(session.length, i + windowSize + 1);&#10;      for (let j = start; j &lt; end; j++) {&#10;        if (j === i) continue;&#10;        updateSkipGram(center, session[j], embeddings, embeddingDim);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return embeddings;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span